select c.id, $L$m9-03$L$, $L$Test Tools$L$, 9, $L$K1$L$, null, null, $L$Which category of test tool is designed to support test planning, monitoring, scheduling, and traceability of test cases to requirements?$L$, $J$[{"text":"Test management tools","correct":true,"why":"Test management tools support planning, monitoring, control and traceability across the test process."},{"text":"Performance testing tools","correct":false,"why":"Performance tools generate load and measure behaviour under load, not manage the overall test process."},{"text":"Static analysis tools","correct":false,"why":"Static analysis tools examine code or artefacts without executing them; they do not manage the test process."},{"text":"Test data preparation tools","correct":false,"why":"Data preparation tools create or mask test data; they do not handle planning or traceability."}]$J$::jsonb, $L$Test management (and application lifecycle management) tools coordinate the test process: planning, scheduling, monitoring progress, managing test cases and providing traceability from requirements through to results and defects.$L$, $L$A test lead uses a test management tool to link each of 40 requirements to its test cases, so that when a requirement changes she can instantly see which tests need re-running and report coverage to stakeholders.$L$
